          {
            "text": "Qwen/Qwen3-14B, Qwen/Qwen3-14B-Base, and Qwen/Qwen3-14B-FP8 each declare Qwen3ForCausalLM, SiLU, bfloat16, and dimensions 5120/17408. The same dimension mapping and explicit activation policy apply to each.",
            "basis": "source",
